ease is hidden or not. If a release is hidden. Only Administrators and member with <code>view_hidden_releases</code> (Developer) capability can install the release via package installer.":28,"Release Name":29,"Release Number":30,"Release Date":31,"Release Key":32,"Release Type":33,"CRC":34,"Required Version":35,"Minimum Version":36,"Release Note":37,"Release Info":38,"On Before Install":39,"On After Install":40,"Extra parameters":41,"Remote file":42,"List of remote file, separate by new line":43,"Patron Level":44,"Post title":45,"Release post":46,"Excerpt of the post":47},"tags":[],"relPath":"/addons/adminTools/!post.html","originalFormat":"Autogenerated TRANS obj","type":"","progress":{"translated":47,"length":47,"percent":100},"parameters":[]},"/addons/adminTools/!postPackage.html":{"data":[["Select package json file","Package json dosyasını seçin"],["Select the generated patch file","Oluşturulan yama dosyasını seçin"],["Or Select Destination File","Veya Hedef Dosyayı Seçin"],["Or Download location","Veya İndirme konumu"],["Icon","Simge"],["Author","Yazar"],["Name","Ad"],["name of the package.","paketin adı."],["Title","Başlık"],["Title of the package.","Paketin başlığı."],["Version","Sürüm"],["Version of the package.","Paketin sürümü."],["Description","Açıklama"],["Description of the package.","Paketin açıklaması."],["Whether this release is active or not.","Bu yayının etkin olup olmadığı."],["Whether this release is hidden or not.","Bu yayının gizli olup olmadığı."],["Patron Level","Patron Seviyesi"],["Current month's pledge in $","Mevcut ayın taahhüdü $ cinsinden"],["Patron Points","Patron Puanları"],["100pts = 1$","100 puan = 1$"],["Purchase type","Satın alma türü"],["Type of the purchase.","Satın alma türü."],["On Before Install","Kurulum Öncesi"],["Javascript code to be run before install","Kurulumdan önce çalıştırılacak Javascript kodu"],["On After Install","Kurulum Sonrası"],["Javascript code to be run after install","Kurulumdan sonra çalıştırılacak Javascript kodu"],["Manifest","Manifest"],["Manifest data","Manifest verisi"],["Minimum version","Minimum sürüm"],["Minimum version of Translator++ to be able to insatall this addon.","Bu eklentiyi kurabilmek için Translator++'ın minimum sürümü."],["Release Date","Yayın Tarihi"],["Is parser changed?","Ayrıştırıcı değişti mi?"],["Mark as parser change. Would warn the user to backup their project before updating to this addon.","Ayrıştırıcı değişikliği olarak işaretle. Kullanıcıyı bu eklentiye güncellemeden önce projelerini yedeklemeleri konusunda uyarır."],["Remove the same version found on database.","Veritabanında bulunan aynı sürümü kaldır."],["Excluded files","Hariç tutulan dosyalar"],["Files listed here will be excluded from the distribution packages","Burada listelenen dosyalar dağıtım paketlerinden hariç tutulacaktır"],["Script URL","Komut dosyası URL'si"],["Script of the URL.","URL'nin komut dosyası."],["Upload script","Betiği yükle"],["This script will be uploaded to the back-end and will be processed with [php]Scripts template script.\n\t\t\t\t\tTo use this feature:\n\t\t\t\t\t<ol>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Create a wordpress page with <b>[php]Scripts template</b> template.<br>You can also set the patreon's requirement to view the post.</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Add the url to the page into the package.json file with <b>l</b> GET parameter point to the local file.<br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tFor example : <u>https://dreamsavior.net/script/translation-proxy/?l=/sub.js</u>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t</ol>\n\t\t\t\t","Bu betik arka uca yüklenecek ve [php]Scripts şablon betiği ile işlenecek.\n\t\t\t\t\tBu özelliği kullanmak için:\n\t\t\t\t\t<ol>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><b>[php]Scripts şablonu</b> şablonuyla bir wordpress sayfası oluşturun.<br>Gönderiyi görüntülemek için patreon gereksinimini de ayarlayabilirsiniz.</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Sayfanın URL'sini, yerel dosyayı işaret eden <b>l</b> GET parametresiyle package.json dosyasına ekleyin.<br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tÖrneğin: <u>https://dreamsavior.net/script/translation-proxy/?l=/sub.js</u>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t</ol>\n\t\t\t\t"],["Actions","Eylemler"]],"context":[["idx/0/innerText"],["idx/1/innerText","idx/3/innerText"],["idx/2/innerText"],["idx/4/innerText"],["idx/6/innerText"],["idx/8/innerText"],["idx/10/innerText"],["idx/11/innerText"],["idx/12/innerText"],["idx/13/innerText"],["idx/14/innerText"],["idx/15/innerText"],["idx/16/innerText"],["idx/17/innerText"],["idx/18/innerText"],["idx/19/innerText"],["idx/20/innerText"],["idx/21/innerText"],["idx/22/innerText"],["idx/23/innerText"],["idx/24/innerText"],["idx/25/innerText"],["idx/26/innerText"],["idx/27/innerText"],["idx/28/innerText"],["idx/29/innerText"],["idx/30/innerText"],["idx/31/innerText"],["idx/32/innerText"],["idx/33/innerText"],["idx/34/innerText"],["idx/36/innerText"],["idx/37/innerText"],["idx/38/innerText"],["idx/39/innerText"],["idx/40/innerText"],["idx/41/innerText"],["idx/42/innerText"],["idx/43/innerText"],["idx/44/innerText"],["idx/47/innerText"]],"basename":"!postPackage.html","dirname":"/addons/adminTools","extension":".html","filename":"!postPackage.html","path":"/addons/adminTools/!postPackage.html","indexIsBuilt":false,"indexIds":{"Select package json file":0,"Select the generated patch file":1,"Or Select Destination File":2,"Or Download location":3,"":4,"Icon":5,"Author":6,"Name":7,"name of the package.":8,"Title":9,"Title of the package.":10,"Version":11,"Version of the package.":12,"Description":13,"Description of the package.":14,"Whether this release is active or not.":15,"Whether this release is hidden or not.":16,"Patron Level":17,"Current month's pledge in $":18,"Patron Points":19,"100pts = 1$":20,"Purchase type":21,"Type of the purchase.":22,"On Before Install":23,"Javascript code to be run before install":24,"On After Install":25,"Javascript code to be run after install":26,"Manifest":27,"Manifest data":28,"Minimum version":29,"Minimum version of Translator++ to be able to insatall this addon.":30,"Release Date":31,"Is parser changed?":32,"Mark as parser change. Would warn the user to backup their project before updating to this addon.":33,"Remove the same version found on database.":34,"Excluded files":35,"Files listed here will be excluded from the distribution packages":36,"Script URL":37,"Script of the URL.":38,"Upload script":39,"This script will be uploaded to the back-end and will be processed with [php]Scripts template script.\n\t\t\t\t\tTo use this feature:\n\t\t\t\t\t<ol>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Create a wordpress page with <b>[php]Scripts template</b> template.<br>You can also set the patreon's requirement to view the post.</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Add the url to the page into the package.json file with <b>l</b> GET parameter point to the local file.<br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tFor example : <u>https://dreamsavior.net/script/translation-proxy/?l=/sub.js</u>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t</ol>\n\t\t\t\t":40,"Actions":41},"tags":[],"relPath":"/addons/adminTools/!postPackage.html","originalFormat":"Autogenerated TRANS obj","type":"","progress":{"translated":41,"length":41,"percent":100},"parameters":[]},"/addons/adminTools/adminTools.js":{"data":[["Close","Kapat"]],"context":[["tid/588/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"adminTools.js","dirname":"/addons/adminTools","extension":".js","filename":"adminTools.js","path":"/addons/adminTools/adminTools.js","indexIsBuilt":false,"indexIds":{"Close":0},"tags":[],"relPath":"/addons/adminTools/adminTools.js","originalFormat":"Autogenerated TRANS obj","type":"","progress":{"translated":1,"length":1,"percent":100},"parameters":[]},"/addons/aec/aec.js":{"data":[["Universal Archive Unpacker","Evrensel Arşip Açıcı"]],"context":[["tid/1001/type/StringLiteral","tid/1239/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"aec.js","dirname":"/addons/aec","extension":".js","filename":"aec.js","path":"/addons/aec/aec.js","indexIsBuilt":false,"indexIds":{"Universal Archive Unpacker":0},"tags":[],"relPath":"/addons/aec/aec.js","originalFormat":"Autogenerated TRANS obj","type":"","progress":{"translated":1,"length":1,"percent":100},"parameters":[]},"/addons/bakinParser/bakin-proxy.js":{"data":[["Extract a Bakin game dictionary from data.rbpack, translate dic.txt, and patch the player automatically.","Bir Bakin oyunu sözlüğünü data.rbpack'ten çıkarın, dic.txt'yi çevirin ve oynatıcıyı otomatik olarak yamalayın."],["Create project","Proje oluştur"],["Error: customField is not defined. This should not happen!","Hata: customField tanımlanmamış. Bu olmamalı!"],["Please select the Bakin game executable.","Lütfen Bakin oyunu yürütülebilir dosyasını seçin."],["<h2>Proxy workflow</h2>","<h2>Proxy iş akışı</h2>"],["Translator++ unpacks data.rbpack into a temporary folder.","Translator++, data.rbpack'i geçici bir klasöre açar."],["Split Dictionary uses dump-split and creates one .txt file per source area by default.","Bölünmüş Sözlük, dump-split kullanır ve varsayılan olarak kaynak alan başına bir .txt dosyası oluşturur."],["Merge Dictionary uses a single dic.txt.","Birleştirilmiş Sözlük, tek bir dic.txt kullanır."],["Injection merges split dictionaries back into data/dic.txt and patches the player executable.","Enjeksiyon, bölünmüş sözlükleri data/dic.txt'ye geri birleştirir ve oynatıcı yürütülebilir dosyasını yamalar."],["Split Dictionary (default)","Bölünmüş Sözlük (varsayılan)"],["Merge Dictionary","Birleştirilmiş Sözlük"]],"context":[["tid/2860/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2929/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2966/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3002/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3253/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/3266/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3277/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3288/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3299/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3383/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3393/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"bakin-proxy.js","dirname":"/addons/bakinParser","extension":".js","filename":"bakin-proxy.js","path":"/addons/bakinParser/bakin-proxy.js","indexIsBuilt":false,"indexIds":{"Extract a Bakin game dictionary from data.rbpack, translate dic.txt, and patch the player automatically.":0,"Create project":1,"Error: customField is not defined. This should not happen!":2,"Please select the Bakin game executable.":3,"<h2>Proxy workflow</h2>":4,"Translator++ unpacks data.rbpack into a temporary folder.":5,"Split Dictionary uses dump-split and creates one .txt file per source area by default.":6,"Merge Dictionary uses a single dic.txt.":7,"Injection merges split dictionaries back into data/dic.txt and patches the player executable.":8,"Split Dictionary (default)":9,"Merge Dictionary":10},"tags":[],"relPath":"/addons/bakinParser/bakin-proxy.js","originalFormat":"Autogenerated TRANS obj","type":"","progress":{"translated":11,"length":11,"percent":100},"parameters":[]},"/addons/bakinParser/bakin-xlsx.js":{"data":[["Start a translation project from RPG Developer Bakin localization sheet (xlsx).","RPG Developer Bakin yerelleştirme sayfasından (xlsx) bir çeviri projesi başlatın."],["Create project","Proje oluştur"],["Error: customField is not defined. This should not happen!","Hata: customField tanımlanmamış. Bu olmamalı!"],["Please select the entry point to translate.","Lütfen çevrilecek giriş noktasını seçin."],["<h2>RPG Developer Bakin editor is required</h2>","<h2>RPG Developer Bakin editörü gereklidir</h2>"],["RPG Developer Bakin editor is required to start the translation project.","Çeviri projesine başlamak için RPG Developer Bakin editörü gereklidir."],["<h2>Before you start</h2>","<h2>Başlamadan önce</h2>"],["<a href=\"#\" onclick=\"addonLoader.addons.bakinParser.openDecompileForm()\">Unpack your game</a> into editable RPG Developer Bakin's project.","<a href=\"#\" onclick=\"addonLoader.addons.bakinParser.openDecompileForm()\">Oyununuzu</a> düzenlenebilir RPG Developer Bakin projesine çıkarın."],["Export the localization strings by using RPG Developer Bakin application into a xlsx file. <a href=\"https://dreamsavior.net/docs/rpg-developer-bakin/how-to-translate-rpg-developer-bakin/\" class=\"externalLink\" external=\"true\">See the guide here on how to translate Bakin game</a>.","RPG Developer Bakin uygulamasını kullanarak yerelleştirme dizelerini bir xlsx dosyasına aktarın. <a href=\"https://dreamsavior.net/docs/rpg-developer-bakin/how-to-translate-rpg-developer-bakin/\" class=\"externalLink\" external=\"true\">Bakin oyununu nasıl çevireceğinize dair kılavuza buradan bakın</a>."]],"context":[["tid/614/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/683/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/720/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/756/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1034/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1041/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1064/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1077/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1088/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"]],"basename":"bakin-xlsx.js","dirname":"/addons/bakinParser","extension":".js","filename":"bakin-xlsx.js","path":"/addons/bakinParser/bakin-xlsx.js","indexIsBuilt":false,"indexIds":{"Start a translation project from RPG Developer Bakin localization sheet (xlsx).":0,"Create project":1,"Error: customField is not defined. This should not happen!":2,"Please select the entry point to translate.":3,"<h2>RPG Developer Bakin editor is required</h2>":4,"RPG Developer Bakin editor is required to start the translation project.":5,"<h2>Before you start</h2>":6,"<a href=\"#\" onclick=\"addonLoader.addons.bakinParser.openDecompileForm()\">Unpack your game</a> into editable RPG Developer Bakin's project.":7,"Export the localization strings by using RPG Developer Bakin application into a xlsx file. <a href=\"https://dreamsavior.net/docs/rpg-developer-bakin/how-to-translate-rpg-developer-bakin/\" class=\"externalLink\" external=\"true\">See the guide here on how to translate Bakin game</a>.":8},"tags":[],"relPath":"/addons/bakinParser/bakin-xlsx.js","originalFormat":"Autogenerated TRANS obj","type":"","progress":{"translated":9,"length":9,"percent":100},"parameters":[]},"/addons/basicUtils/basicUtils.js":{"data":[["NWJS Version","NWJS Sürümü"],["Change into this NWJS version","Bu NWJS sürümüne değiştir"],["Use Developer version","Geliştirici sürümünü kullan"],["Use the NWJS Developer version. The Developer version has developer tools available. Suitable for debugging and development.","NWJS Geliştirici sürümünü kullanın. Geliştirici sürümünde geliştirici araçları mevcuttur. Hata ayıklama ve geliştirme için uygundur."],["In Developer version you can use <b>Developer Console</b>. Developer Console can be accessed by pressing F12 or right-clicking the app and selecting 'Inspect'.","Geliştirici sürümünde <b>Geliştirici Konsolu</b> kullanabilirsiniz. Geliştirici Konsolu'na F12'ye basarak veya uygulamaya sağ tıklayıp 'İncele'yi seçerek erişebilirsiniz."],["Use 32-bit version","32-bit sürümü kullan"],["Use the 32-bit version of NWJS. The 32-bit version is useful for compatibility with older systems. It is recommended to uncheck this option if possible (just upgrade your machine, dude).","NWJS'in 32-bit sürümünü kullanın. 32-bit sürümü eski sistemlerle uyumluluk için faydalıdır. Mümkünse bu seçeneği işaretlememeniz önerilir (sadece makinenizi yükseltin, dostum)."],["Some Translator++ feature may not work across NWJS version","Bazı Translator++ özellikleri NWJS sürümleri arasında çalışmayabilir"],["Please be aware that some Translator++ feature may not work across NWJS version. Make sure to test your project after changing the NWJS version.","Lütfen bazı Translator++ özelliklerinin NWJS sürümleri arasında çalışmayabileceğini unutmayın. NWJS sürümünü değiştirdikten sonra projenizi test ettiğinizden emin olun."],["You're currently running on NWJS ver.","Şu anda NWJS sür. üzerinde çalışıyorsunuz"],["Change Translator++ Core NWJS version","Translator++ Çekirdek NWJS sürümünü değiştir"],["You're already using the selected NWJS version.","Zaten seçili NWJS sürümünü kullanıyorsunuz."],["This operation will close Translator++ and change the current NW.js version into","Bu işlem Translator++'ı kapatacak ve mevcut NW.js sürümünü şuna değiştirecektir"],["If you have any unsaved changes, please select 'Cancel' and save your project first.\nDo you want to continue?","Kaydedilmemiş değişiklikleriniz varsa, lütfen 'İptal' seçin ve önce projenizi kaydedin.\nDevam etmek istiyor musunuz?"]],"context":[["tid/1342/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1352/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1428/type/StringLiteral","tid/1617/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1438/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1449/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1482/type/StringLiteral","tid/1641/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1492/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1532/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1537/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1542/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1669/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1745/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1769/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1782/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"]],"basename":"basicUtils.js","dirname":"/addons/basicUtils","extension":".js","filename":"basicUtils.js","path":"/addons/basicUtils/basicUtils.js","indexIsBuilt":false,"indexIds":{"NWJS Version":0,"Change into this NWJS version":1,"Use Developer version":2,"Use the NWJS Developer version. The Developer version has developer tools available. Suitable for debugging and development.":3,"In Developer version you can use <b>Developer Console</b>. Developer Console can be accessed by pressing F12 or right-clicking the app and selecting 'Inspect'.":4,"Use 32-bit version":5,"Use the 32-bit version of NWJS. The 32-bit version is useful for compatibility with older systems. It is recommended to uncheck this option if possible (just upgrade your machine, dude).":6,"Some Translator++ feature may not work across NWJS version":7,"Please be aware that some Translator++ feature may not work across NWJS version. Make sure to test your project after changing the NWJS version.":8,"You're currently running on NWJS ver.":9,"Change Translator++ Core NWJS version":10,"You're already using the selected NWJS version.":11,"This operation will close Translator++ and change the current NW.js version into":12,"If you have any unsaved changes, please select 'Cancel' and save your project first.\nDo you want to continue?":13},"tags":[],"relPath":"/addons/basicUtils/basicUtils.js","originalFormat":"Autogenerated TRANS obj","type":"","progress":{"translated":14,"length":14,"percent":100},"parameters":[]},"/addons/basicUtils/mainMenu.js":{"data":[["Change Language","Dili Değiştir"],["No MTL available for this language pair","Bu dil çifti için MTL mevcut değil"],["Change default MTL for this project","Bu proje için varsayılan MTL'yi değiştir"],["???","???"],["Search in a folder","Bir klasörde ara"],["Search in Staging Files","Staging Dosyalarında Ara"],["Search in Original Files","Orijinal Dosyalarda Ara"],["No original files path is set for this project.","Bu proje için orijinal dosya yolu ayarlanmamış."],["Search in Translated Files","Çevrilmiş Dosyalarda Ara"],["No translated files path is set for this project.\nYou need to inject your translation once to set the translated files path.","Bu proje için çevrilmiş dosya yolu ayarlanmamış.\nÇevrilmiş dosya yolunu ayarlamak için çevirinizi bir kez enjekte etmeniz gerekir."],["Chat with AI Assistant","AI Asistanıyla Sohbet Et"],["AI Assistant is not available since the new features are not loaded.\nPlease reinstall or re-update Translator++.","Yeni özellikler yüklenmediği için AI Asistanı mevcut değil.\nLütfen Translator++'ı yeniden yükleyin veya güncelleyin."]],"context":[["tid/442/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/729/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/974/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1182/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1339/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1404/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1501/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1539/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1624/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1662/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1777/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1812/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"mainMenu.js","dirname":"/addons/basicUtils","extension":".js","filename":"mainMenu.js","path":"/addons/basicUtils/mainMenu.js","indexIsBuilt":false,"indexIds":{"Change Language":0,"No MTL available for this language pair":1,"Change default MTL for this project":2,"???":3,"Search in a folder":4,"Search in Staging Files":5,"Search in Original Files":6,"No original files path is set for this project.":7,"Search in Translated Files":8,"No translated files path is set for this project.\nYou need to inject your translation once to set the translated files path.":9,"Chat with AI Assistant":10,"AI Assistant is not available since the new features are not loaded.\nPlease reinstall or re-update Translator++.":11},"tags":[],"relPath":"/addons/basicUtils/mainMenu.js","originalFormat":"Autogenerated TRANS obj","type":"","progress":{"translated":12,"length":12,"percent":100},"parameters":[]},"/addons/basicUtils/utils/HTMLPacker.js":{"data":[["Path is not a file:","Yol bir dosya değil:"],["Icon path is not a file:","Simge yolu bir dosya değil:"],["Path is not an exe file:","Yol bir exe dosyası değil:"],["Icon path is not an ico file:","Simge yolu bir ico dosyası değil:"],["Html entry point","Html giriş noktası"],["Select the html entry point file (usually index.html)","Html giriş noktası dosyasını seçin (genellikle index.html)"],["Destination folder","Hedef klasör"],["Select destination folder. The process will replace the existing files.","Hedef klasörü seçin. İşlem mevcut dosyaları değiştirecektir."],["NWJS version","NWJS sürümü"],["Optional. Select NWJS version and architecture.<br />Latest version not always better, just use what works for you.","İsteğe bağlı. NWJS sürümünü ve mimarisini seçin.<br />En son sürüm her zaman daha iyi değildir, sizin için çalışanı kullanın."],["Application ID","Uygulama Kimliği"],["Set the application ID for the game. The ID must be in lowercase and can only contain letters, numbers, and underscores.","Oyun için uygulama kimliğini ayarlayın. Kimlik küçük harflerle olmalı ve yalnızca harfler, rakamlar ve alt çizgiler içerebilir."],["Application description","Uygulama açıklaması"],["Set the application description for the game.","Oyun için uygulama açıklamasını ayarlayın."],["Window title","Pencere başlığı"],["Set the default window title for the game.<br />This value may be overridden by the game engine.","Oyun için varsayılan pencere başlığını ayarlayın.<br />Bu değer oyun motoru tarafından geçersiz kılınabilir."],["Window width","Pencere genişliği"],["Set the default window width for the game.","Oyun için varsayılan pencere genişliğini ayarlayın."],["Window height","Pencere yüksekliği"],["Set the default window height for the game.","Oyun için varsayılan pencere yüksekliğini ayarlayın."],["Full screen","Tam ekran"],["Set the game to start in full screen mode.","Oyunu tam ekran modunda başlatacak şekilde ayarlayın."],["Resizable","Yeniden boyutlandırılabilir"],["Set the game window to be resizable.","Oyun penceresinin yeniden boyutlandırılabilir olmasını ayarlayın."],["Game icon","Oyun simgesi"],["Select the icon file for the game executable. The icon file must be in .ico format. The icon will be embedded in the game executable.","Oyun yürütülebiliri için simge dosyasını seçin. Simge dosyası .ico formatında olmalıdır. Simge, oyun yürütülebilirine gömülecektir."],["Through this form, you can create a playable package of your game. <br />The process will replace the existing files in the destination folder.","Bu form aracılığıyla, oyununuzun oynanabilir bir paketini oluşturabilirsiniz. <br />İşlem, hedef klasördeki mevcut dosyaları değiştirecektir."],["Start the application in full screen mode","Uygulamayı tam ekran modunda başlat"],["Allow the application to be resizable","Uygulamanın yeniden boyutlandırılabilir olmasına izin ver"],["HTML Compiler","HTML Derleyici"],["Compile","Derle"],["Source path can not empty","Kaynak yolu boş olamaz"],["Destination path can not empty","Hedef yolu boş olamaz"]],"context":[["tid/86/type/StringLiteral","tid/4136/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/116/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/151/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/186/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2424/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2434/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2474/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2484/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2524/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2534/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2587/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2597/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2631/type/StringLiteral","tid/3795/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2641/type/StringLiteral","tid/3805/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2675/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2685/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2722/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2732/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2766/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2776/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2810/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2820/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2854/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2864/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2899/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2909/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2950/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/3900/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3924/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4020/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4037/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4083/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4104/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"HTMLPacker.js","dirname":"/addons/basicUtils/utils","extension":".js","filename":"HTMLPacker.js","path":"/addons/basicUtils/utils/HTMLPacker.js","indexIsBuilt":false,"indexIds":{"Path is not a file:":0,"Icon path is not a file:":1,"Path is not an exe file:":2,"Icon path is not an ico file:":3,"Html entry point":4,"Select the html entry point file (usually index.html)":5,"Destination folder":6,"Select destination folder. The process will replace the existing files.":7,"NWJS version":8,"Optional. Select NWJS version and architecture.<br />Latest version not always better, just use what works for you.":9,"Application ID":10,"Set the application ID for the game. The ID must be in lowercase and can only contain letters, numbers, and underscores.":11,"Application description":12,"Set the application description for the game.":13,"Window title":14,"Set the default window title for the game.<br />This value may be overridden by the game engine.":15,"Window width":16,"Set the default window width for the game.":17,"Window height":18,"Set the default window height for the game.":19,"Full screen":20,"Set the game to start in full screen mode.":21,"Resizable":22,"Set the game window to be resizable.":23,"Game icon":24,"Select the icon file for the game executable. The icon file must be in .ico format. The icon will be embedded in the game executable.":25,"Through this form, you can create a playable package of your game. <br />The process will replace the existing files in the destination folder.":26,"Start the application in full screen mode":27,"Allow the application to be resizable":28,"HTML Compiler":29,"Compile":30,"Source path can not empty":31,"Destination path can not empty":32},"tags":[],"relPath":"/addons/basicUtils/utils/HTMLPacker.js","originalFormat":"Autogenerated TRANS obj","type":"","progress":{"translated":33,"length":33,"percent":100},"parameters":[]},"/addons/basicUtils/utils/Updater.js":{"data":[["An update is being installed. Please do not close the application until the installation is completed.","Bir güncelleme yükleniyor. Lütfen yükleme tamamlanana kadar uygulamayı kapatmayın."],["Package Path","Paket Yolu"],["Select the package file.","Paket dosyasını seçin."],["Package Key","Paket Anahtarı"],["If you have the key, please enter it here. If not, leave it empty.","Anahtarınız varsa lütfen buraya girin. Yoksa boş bırakın."],["Through this form, you can update Translator++ with the updater package file. You can download the updater package <a href=\"https://dreamsavior.net/translator-plusplus/translator-update-package/\" external>here</a>.","Bu form aracılığıyla, Translator++'ı güncelleyici paket dosyasıyla güncelleyebilirsiniz. Güncelleyici paketi <a href=\"https://dreamsavior.net/translator-plusplus/translator-update-package/\" external>buradan</a> indirebilirsiniz."],["Update from package","Paketten güncelle"],["Update","Güncelle"],["Update Translator++","Translator++'ı Güncelle"]],"context":[["tid/4918/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6562/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6572/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6612/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6622/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6661/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/6753/type/StringLiteral","tid/7195/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6770/type/StringLiteral","tid/7091/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/7120/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"Updater.js","dirname":"/addons/basicUtils/utils","extension":".js","filename":"Updater.js","path":"/addons/basicUtils/utils/Updater.js","indexIsBuilt":false,"indexIds":{"An update is being installed. Please do not close the application until the installation is completed.":0,"Package Path":1,"Select the package file.":2,"Package Key":3,"If you have the key, please enter it here. If not, leave it empty.":4,"Through this form, you can update Translator++ with the updater package file. You can download the updater package <a href=\"https://dreamsavior.net/translator-plusplus/translator-update-package/\" external>here</a>.":5,"Update from package":6,"Update":7,"Update Translator++":8},"tags":[],"relPath":"/addons/basicUtils/utils/Updater.js","originalFormat":"Autogenerated TRANS obj","type":"","progress":{"translated":9,"length":9,"percent":100},"parameters":[]},"/addons/basicUtils/utils/info.js":{"data":[["You have ","Kaçırdığınız "],[" missed update(s)!"," güncelleme var!"],["Translator++ will update itself if auto-update is enabled.","Translator++, otomatik güncelleme etkinse kendini güncelleyecektir."],["You can download the latest core version of Translator++ at","Translator++'ın en son çekirdek sürümünü şuradan indirebilirsiniz:"],["This update is available for all patrons.","Bu güncelleme tüm destekçiler için mevcuttur."],["This update is available for tier $","Bu güncelleme $"],[" patrons or greater."," seviye veya üzeri destekçiler için mevcuttur."],["You're up-to-date!","Güncelsiniz!"],["Thanks for staying up to date with Translator++! You're on the newest version, and we appreciate your support. Enjoy translating!","Translator++ ile güncel kaldığınız için teşekkür ederiz! En yeni sürümdesiniz ve desteğiniz için minnettarız. Çeviri keyfini sürün!"],["Some update information may be shown from cache. You can click <b>'Check for update'</b> to load the latest version details.","Bazı güncelleme bilgileri önbellekten gösterilebilir. En son sürüm detaylarını yüklemek için <b>'Güncellemeyi kontrol et'</b> üzerine tıklayabilirsiniz."],["When the same version is available","Aynı sürüm mevcut olduğunda"],["Allow Translator++ to reinstall the same version of Translator++.","Translator++'ın aynı sürümünü yeniden yüklemeye izin ver."],["Allow reinstall the same version","Aynı sürümü yeniden yüklemeye izin ver"],["Update Settings","Güncelleme Ayarları"],["Update Now","Şimdi Güncelle"],["Updater is not available, please update Translator++ manually.","Güncelleyici mevcut değil, lütfen Translator++'ı manuel olarak güncelleyin."],["Updating Translator++","Translator++ Güncelleniyor"],["Please don't close Translator++ until the update process is finished.","Güncelleme işlemi bitene kadar lütfen Translator++'ı kapatmayın."],["Can not update, reason :\n","Güncellenemiyor, sebep:\n"],["You may need to reconnect Translator++ with your Patreon account (logout and login again).","Translator++'ı Patreon hesabınızla yeniden bağlamanız gerekebilir (çıkış yapıp tekrar giriş yapın)."],["Also, it has been reported that some countries such as mainland China are blocking dropbox repository.","Ayrıca, Çin ana karası gibi bazı ülkelerin dropbox deposunu engellediği bildirilmiştir."],["If for some reason you cannot access our repository, please manually download the update package (tpch file) using a proxy or VPN here:","Eğer bir nedenden dolayı depomuza erişemiyorsanız, lütfen bir proxy veya VPN kullanarak güncelleme paketini (tpch dosyası) manuel olarak buradan indirin:"],["After that, please use the \"Update from package\" feature to update your Translator++.","Bundan sonra, lütfen Translator++'ınızı güncellemek için \"Paketten güncelle\" özelliğini kullanın."],["If you still have problems, please contact us at our Discord server : ","Hala sorun yaşıyorsanız, lütfen Discord sunucumuzda bizimle iletişime geçin:"],["Restart","Yeniden Başlat"],["Do you want to restart Translator++ now?\nIf you have unsaved work, cancel this dialog and save your work first.","Translator++'ı şimdi yeniden başlatmak istiyor musunuz?\nKaydedilmemiş işiniz varsa, bu iletişim kutusunu iptal edin ve önce işinizi kaydedin."],["Check for Update","Güncellemeyi Kontrol Et"],["Close","Kapat"]],"context":[["tid/649/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/660/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/665/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/670/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1033/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1077/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1088/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1665/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1670/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1675/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1755/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1765/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1811/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1873/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2021/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2066/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2116/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2130/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2176/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2192/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2206/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2220/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2245/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/2259/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2357/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2377/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2449/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2512/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"info.js","dirname":"/addons/basicUtils/utils","extension":".js","filename":"info.js","path":"/addons/basicUtils/utils/info.js","indexIsBuilt":false,"indexIds":{"You have ":0," missed update(s)!":1,"Translator++ will update itself if auto-update is enabled.":2,"You can download the latest core version of Translator++ at":3,"This update is available for all patrons.":4,"This update is available for tier $":5," patrons or greater.":6,"You're up-to-date!":7,"Thanks for staying up to date with Translator++! You're on the newest version, and we appreciate your support. Enjoy translating!":8,"Some update information may be shown from cache. You can click <b>'Check for update'</b> to load the latest version details.":9,"When the same version is available":10,"Allow Translator++ to reinstall the same version of Translator++.":11,"Allow reinstall the same version":12,"Update Settings":13,"Update Now":14,"Updater is not available, please update Translator++ manually.":15,"Updating Translator++":16,"Please don't close Translator++ until the update process is finished.":17,"Can not update, reason :\n":18,"You may need to reconnect Translator++ with your Patreon account (logout and login again).":19,"Also, it has been reported that some countries such as mainland China are blocking dropbox repository.":20,"If for some reason you cannot access our repository, please manually download the update package (tpch file) using a proxy or VPN here:":21,"After that, please use the \"Update from package\" feature to update your Translator++.":22,"If you still have problems, please contact us at our Discord server : ":23,"Restart":24,"Do you want to restart Translator++ now?\nIf you have unsaved work, cancel this dialog and save your work first.":25,"Check for Update":26,"Close":27},"tags":[],"relPath":"/addons/basicUtils/utils/info.js","originalFormat":"Autogenerated TRANS obj","type":"","progress":{"translated":28,"length":28,"percent":100},"parameters":[]},"/addons/basicUtils/utils/uiTags.js":{"data":[["Do not process row with selected tag (blacklist)","Seçilen etikete sahip satırı işleme (kara liste)"],["Only process row with selected tag (whitelist)","Yalnızca seçilen etikete sahip satırı işle (beyaz liste)"],["Ignore tag","Etiketi yoksay"],["Load last selection","Son seçimi yükle"],["Reset","Sıfırla"],["Cancel","İptal"],["Confirm","Onayla"]],"context":[["tid/55/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/60/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/65/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/410/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/415/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2085/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2137/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"uiTags.js","dirname":"/addons/basicUtils/utils","extension":".js","filename":"uiTags.js","path":"/addons/basicUtils/utils/uiTags.js","indexIsBuilt":false,"indexIds":{"Do not process row with selected tag (blacklist)":0,"Only process row with selected tag (whitelist)":1,"Ignore tag":2,"Load last selection":3,"Reset":4,"Cancel":5,"Confirm":6},"tags":[],"relPath":"/addons/basicUtils/utils/uiTags.js","originalFormat":"Autogenerated TRANS obj","type":"","progress":{"translated":7,"length":7,"percent":100},"parameters":[]},"/addons/customParser/CustomParserLoader.js":{"data":[["List of the possible character encodings. <b>Order does matter!</b>. Separate each value with a comma.<br />Translator++ will read the original file with the following encodings, patch the files and write with the <b>Write Character encoding</b> option. Leave blank to use the original character encoding when the project is created.","Olası karakter kodlamalarının listesi. <b>Sıra önemlidir!</b>. Her değeri virgülle ayırın.<br />Translator++ orijinal dosyayı aşağıdaki kodlamalarla okuyacak, dosyaları düzenleyip <b>Yazma Karakter Kodlaması</b> seçeneğiyle yazacaktır. Boş bırakılırsa, proje oluşturulduğunda orijinal karakter kodlaması kullanılır."],["For BOM support, add a space after the encoding. Example: <code>utf8 bom</code>","BOM desteği için, kodlamadan sonra bir boşluk ekleyin. Örnek: <code>utf8 bom</code>"],["Example: utf8,utf8 bom,utf16le,ascii","Örnek: utf8,utf8 bom,utf16le,ascii"],["Select the target character encoding.","Hedef karakter kodlamasını seçin."]],"context":[["tid/3375/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/3383/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3392/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4740/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"CustomParserLoader.js","dirname":"/addons/customParser","extension":".js","filename":"CustomParserLoader.js","path":"/addons/customParser/CustomParserLoader.js","indexIsBuilt":false,"indexIds":{"List of the possible character encodings. <b>Order does matter!</b>. Separate each value with a comma.<br />Translator++ will read the original file with the following encodings, patch the files and write with the <b>Write Character encoding</b> option. Leave blank to use the original character encoding when the project is created.":0,"For BOM support, add a space after the encoding. Example: <code>utf8 bom</code>":1,"Example: utf8,utf8 bom,utf16le,ascii":2,"Select the target character encoding.":3},"tags":[],"relPath":"/addons/customParser/CustomParserLoader.js","originalFormat":"Autogenerated TRANS obj","type":"","progress":{"translated":4,"length":4,"percent":100},"parameters":[]},"/addons/customParser/modelEditor/modelEditor.html":{"data":[["<i class=\"icon-edit\"></i>","<i class=\"icon-edit\"></i>"],["<i class=\"icon-plus-circled\"></i><label data-tran=\"\">Add a new file group</label>","<i class=\"icon-plus-circled\"></i><label data-tran=\"\">Yeni bir dosya grubu ekle</label>"],["Add a new file group","Yeni bir dosya grubu ekle"],["<i class=\"icon-cancel-circled red\"></i><label data-tran=\"\">Remove current file group</label>","<i class=\"icon-cancel-circled red\"></i><label data-tran=\"\">Mevcut dosya grubunu kaldır</label>"],["Remove current file group","Mevcut dosya grubunu kaldır"],["Rules","Kurallar"],["Hooks","Kancalar"],["Options","Seçenekler"],["Testing","Test"],["Interpolate the strings before being displayed on the cells. <b>To Grid</b> is antithesis of <b>From Grid</b>","Hücrelerde görüntülenmeden önce dizeleri enterpole edin. <b>Kılavuza</b>, <b>Kılavuzdan</b>'ın karşıtıdır"],["Example","Örnek"],["For example, the text obtained from the parser is as follows:","Örneğin, ayrıştırıcıdan elde edilen metin şu şekildedir:"],["In this grid it will look like this:","Bu kılavuzda şöyle görünecek:"],["That's not the easiest text to work with.<br>\n  We can fix that by declaring <span class=\"inlineCode\">To Grid hooks</span> as follows:\n","Bu, üzerinde çalışılması en kolay metin değil.<br>\n  Bunu, <span class=\"inlineCode\">Kılavuza kancaları</span>'nı şu şekilde tanımlayarak düzeltebiliriz:\n"],["With the hook above the text in the grid will be :","Yukarıdaki kanca ile kılavuzdaki metin şöyle olacak:"],["Interpolate the strings from the cells into the translation result. <b>From Grid</b> is antithesis of <b>To Grid</b>.","Hücrelerden gelen dizeleri çeviri sonucuna enterpole edin. <b>Kılavuzdan</b>, <b>Kılavuza</b>'nın karşıtıdır."],["\n  For example, the expected translated strings should be in JSON format.<br>\n  But writing translation in JSON format is not realy the easiest thing to do. <br>\n  So, instead of asking our translator to translate in JSON format, we can just ask them to type normally, and add a <span class=\"inlineCode\">From Grid hook</span> as follows:\n","\n  Örneğin, beklenen çevrilmiş dizeler JSON formatında olmalıdır.<br>\n  Ancak çeviriyi JSON formatında yazmak gerçekten en kolay şey değildir. <br>\n  Bu yüzden, çevirmenimizden JSON formatında çeviri yapmasını istemek yerine, normal yazmasını isteyebilir ve şu şekilde bir <span class=\"inlineCode\">Kılavuzdan kanca</span> ekleyebiliriz:\n"],["\n  With the <span class=\"inlineCode\">From Grid hook</span> above, the following translation ...\n","\n  Yukarıdaki <span class=\"inlineCode\">Kılavuzdan kanca</span> ile, aşağıdaki çeviri ...\n"],["...will be converted into desired format: ","...istenen formata dönüştürülecek: "],["Edit the translated text just before writing it into a file.","Çevrilen metni bir dosyaya yazmadan hemen önce düzenleyin."],["Parameters","Parametreler"],["\n              <h3 data-tran=\"\">text</h3>\n              <p data-tran=\"\">The text that is about to be written into a file.</p>\n            ","\n              <h3 data-tran=\"\">metin</h3>\n              <p data-tran=\"\">Bir dosyaya yazılmak üzere olan metin.</p>\n            "],["text","metin"],["The text that is about to be written into a file.","Bir dosyaya yazılmak üzere olan metin."],["Return value","Dönüş değeri"],["\n              <h3><i>String</i></h3>\n              <p data-tran=\"\">The text that will be written into a file.</p>\n            ","\n              <h3><i>Dize</i></h3>\n              <p data-tran=\"\">Dosyaya yazılacak metin.</p>\n            "],["The text that will be written into a file.","Dosyaya yazılacak metin."],["General","Genel"],["Read character encoding","Karakter kodlamasını oku"],["Force parser to use the following character encoding when reading the file(s).","Dosya(lar)ı okurken aşağıdaki karakter kodlamasını kullanmaya zorla."],["Write character encoding","Karakter kodlamasını yaz"],["Force parser to use the following character encoding when writing the file(s).","Dosya(lar)ı yazarken aşağıdaki karakter kodlamasını kullanmaya zorla."],["You are editing:","Düzenliyorsunuz:"],["Please select the mode of your pattern","Lütfen deseninizin modunu seçin"],["Regular expression Pattern","Düzenli ifade Deseni"],["A valid ECMA Script's regular expression along with the modifier.<br>You can use <a href=\"https://regex101.com/\" class=\"externalLink\" external=\"\">regex101.com</a> to create and test your pattern.","Geçerli bir ECMA Script düzenli ifadesi ve değiştirici ile.<br><a href=\"https://regex101.com/\" class=\"externalLink\" external=\"\">regex101.com</a>'u deseninizi oluşturmak ve test etmek için kullanabilirsiniz."],["Pay attention to the use of carriage return (\\r) in the text to be translated. regex101.com will strip out the carriage returns so your pattern may have a different effect than what you see on regex101. ","Çevrilecek metindeki satır başı (\\r) kullanımına dikkat edin. regex101.com satır başlarını kaldıracağından deseninizin regex101'de gördüğünüzden farklı bir etkisi olabilir."],["<strong>About quantifier that captures a zero length string.</strong><br>\n            <i>Null</i> strings will cause problems for the parser. Therefore, instead of using the <strong>*</strong> quantifier which will also capture <i>nulls</i>, it is highly recommended to use the <strong>+</strong> quantifier which will only capture strings if exist.","<strong>Sıfır uzunluklu dize yakalayan niceleyici hakkında.</strong><br>\n            <i>Boş</i> dizeler ayrıştırıcı için sorunlara neden olacaktır. Bu nedenle, <i>boş</i> dizeleri de yakalayan <strong>*</strong> niceleyicisi yerine, yalnızca dizeler varsa yakalayan <strong>+</strong> niceleyicisini kullanmanız şiddetle tavsiye edilir."],["Translatable Capture groups","Çevrilebilir Yakalama grupları"],["Index of the regular expression's groups (Integer) for the translatable texts. Can be more than one. Separate with comma.","Çevrilebilir metinler için düzenli ifadenin gruplarının indeksi (Tam sayı). Birden fazla olabilir. Virgülle ayırın."],["Row Info Capture group","Satır Bilgisi Yakalama grubu"],["\n            Index of the regular expression's group (Integer) for the row info (e.g. character name). <b>Only one group</b> is allowed. <br>\n            The value of the Row info can be carried over to the child rules and will be overwritten by the child rule's Row info value if exist.\n          ","\n            Satır bilgisi (ör. karakter adı) için düzenli ifadenin grubunun indeksi (Tam sayı). <b>Yalnızca bir grup</b> izin verilir. <br>\n            Satır bilgisinin değeri alt kurallara aktarılabilir ve varsa alt kuralın Satır bilgisi değeri tarafından üzerine yazılır.\n          "],["Context template","Bağlam şablonu"],["\n            Context is unique identifier for translatable texts. <br>\n            You can use Javascript's template literals to add information to the context.<br>\n            <b>Available variable:</b>\n            <ul>\n              <li><span class=\"inlineCode\">GROUP[<i>n</i>]</span> - Group capture.</li>\n              <!-- <li><span class=\"inlineCode\">RULE_ID</span> - The ID of the rule.</li> -->\n            </ul>\n            <br>\n            <b>Example:</b>\n            <pre>item/${GROUP[2]}</pre>\n          ","\n            Bağlam, çevrilebilir metinler için benzersiz tanımlayıcıdır. <br>\n            Bağlama bilgi eklemek için Javascript'in şablon değişmezlerini kullanabilirsiniz.<br>\n            <b>Kullanılabilir değişken:</b>\n            <ul>\n              <li><span class=\"inlineCode\">GROUP[<i>n</i>]</span> - Grup yakalama.</li>\n              <!-- <li><span class=\"inlineCode\">RULE_ID</span> - Kuralın kimliği.</li> -->\n            </ul>\n            <br>\n            <b>Örnek:</b>\n            <pre>item/${GROUP[2]}</pre>\n          "],["Action","Eylem"],["Capture value","Değeri yakala"],["Capture then mask value","Değeri yakala ve maskele"],["Mask value","Değeri maskele"],["Send to inner rule","İç kurala gönder"],["Edit inner rule <i class=\"icon-angle-double-right\"></i>","İç kuralı düzenle <i class=\"icon-angle-double-right\"></i>"],["What action the pattern is going to do.","Desenin yapacağı eylem nedir."],["Javascript function","Javascript fonksiyonu"],["Guide","Kılavuz"],["\n          <h2 data-tran=\"\">Arguments</h2>\n          <p data-tran=\"\">The code you write will be inside a function with 2 arguments that can be accessed anywhere in your code:</p>\n          <ul>\n            <li>\n              <h3>text</h3>\n              <p><b>String</b></p>\n              <p data-tran=\"\">A string of the entire content of the file.</p>\n            </li>\n            <li>\n              <h3>thisModel</h3>\n              <p><b>Object</b></p>\n              <p data-tran=\"\">The rule object that is currently used by the file.</p>\n            </li>\n          </ul>\n          <h2 data-tran=\"\"><i>this</i> Keyword</h2>\n          <p data-tran=\"\"><b>this</b> will reffer to the instance of CustomParser class.</p>\n\n        ","\n          <h2 data-tran=\"\">Argümanlar</h2>\n          <p data-tran=\"\">Yazdığınız kod, kodunuzda her yerde erişilebilen 2 argümanlı bir fonksiyonun içinde olacaktır:</p>\n          <ul>\n            <li>\n              <h3>text</h3>\n              <p><b>String</b></p>\n              <p data-tran=\"\">Dosyanın tüm içeriğinin bir dizesi.</p>\n            </li>\n            <li>\n              <h3>thisModel</h3>\n              <p><b>Object</b></p>\n              <p data-tran=\"\">Dosya tarafından şu anda kullanılan kural nesnesi.</p>\n            </li>\n          </ul>\n          <h2 data-tran=\"\"><i>this</i> Anahtar Kelimesi</h2>\n          <p data-tran=\"\"><b>this</b>, CustomParser sınıfının örneğini ifade edecektir.</p>\n\n        "],["Arguments","Argümanlar"],["The code you write will be inside a function with 2 arguments that can be accessed anywhere in your code:","Yazdığınız kod, kodunuzda her yerde erişilebilen 2 argümanlı bir fonksiyonun içinde olacaktır:"],["A string of the entire content of the file.","Dosyanın tüm içeriğinin bir dizesi."],["The rule object that is currently used by the file.","Dosya tarafından şu anda kullanılan kural nesnesi."],["<i>this</i> Keyword","<i>this</i> Anahtar Kelimesi"],["<b>this</b> will reffer to the instance of CustomParser class.","<b>this</b>, CustomParser sınıfının örneğini ifade edecektir."],["\n          <h2 data-tran=\"\">Expected Return Value</h2>\n          <p data-tran=\"\">Your code must <b>return</b> one of the following value:</p>\n          <ul>\n            <li><pre>undefined</pre></li>\n            <li data-tran=\"\">Offset of the captured text, for example:\n<pre>  {\n    start:100,\n    end:120,\n    rowInfoText:\"Character Name\", // Character name. optional\n    context: [\"some\", \"context\", \"here\"] // Context. optional\n  }\n</pre>\n            </li>\n            <li data-tran=\"\">Array of the offset of the captured text, for example:\n<pre>  [\n    {start:0, end:5, rowInfoText:\"Character Name\", context: [\"some\", \"context\", \"here\"]},\n    {start:12, end:30, rowInfoText:\"Another Character\", context: [\"another\", \"context\"]},\n    {start:4581, end:4593, rowInfoText:\"Third Character\", context: [\"third\", \"context\"]}\n  ]\n</pre>              \n            </li>\n          </ul>\n        ","\n          <h2 data-tran=\"\">Beklenen Dönüş Değeri</h2>\n          <p data-tran=\"\">Kodunuz aşağıdaki değerlerden birini <b>döndürmelidir</b>:</p>\n          <ul>\n            <li><pre>undefined</pre></li>\n            <li data-tran=\"\">Yakalanan metnin ofseti, örneğin:\n<pre>  {\n    start:100,\n    end:120,\n    rowInfoText:\"Karakter Adı\", // Karakter adı. isteğe bağlı\n    context: [\"bazı\", \"bağlam\", \"burada\"] // Bağlam. isteğe bağlı\n  }\n</pre>\n            </li>\n            <li data-tran=\"\">Yakalanan metnin ofsetlerinin dizisi, örneğin:\n<pre>  [\n    {start:0, end:5, rowInfoText:\"Karakter Adı\", context: [\"bazı\", \"bağlam\", \"burada\"]},\n    {start:12, end:30, rowInfoText:\"Başka Karakter\", context: [\"başka\", \"bağlam\"]},\n    {start:4581, end:4593, rowInfoText:\"Üçüncü Karakter\", context: [\"üçüncü\", \"bağlam\"]}\n  ]\n</pre>              \n            </li>\n          </ul>\n        "],["Expected Return Value","Beklenen Dönüş Değeri"],["Your code must <b>return</b> one of the following value:","Kodunuz aşağıdaki değerlerden birini <b>döndürmelidir</b>:"],["Offset of the captured text, for example:\n<pre>  {\n    start:100,\n    end:120,\n    rowInfoText:\"Character Name\", // Character name. optional\n    context: [\"some\", \"context\", \"here\"] // Context. optional\n  }\n</pre>\n            ","Yakalanan metnin ofseti, örneğin:\n<pre>  {\n    start:100,\n    end:120,\n    rowInfoText:\"Karakter Adı\", // Karakter adı. isteğe bağlı\n    context: [\"bazı\", \"bağlam\", \"burada\"] // Bağlam. isteğe bağlı\n  }\n</pre>\n            "],["Array of the offset of the captured text, for example:\n<pre>  [\n    {start:0, end:5, rowInfoText:\"Character Name\", context: [\"some\", \"context\", \"here\"]},\n    {start:12, end:30, rowInfoText:\"Another Character\", context: [\"another\", \"context\"]},\n    {start:4581, end:4593, rowInfoText:\"Third Character\", context: [\"third\", \"context\"]}\n  ]\n</pre>              \n            ","Yakalanan metnin ofsetlerinin dizisi, örneğin:\n<pre>  [\n    {start:0, end:5, rowInfoText:\"Karakter Adı\", context: [\"bazı\", \"bağlam\", \"burada\"]},\n    {start:12, end:30, rowInfoText:\"Başka Karakter\", context: [\"başka\", \"bağlam\"]},\n    {start:4581, end:4593, rowInfoText:\"Üçüncü Karakter\", context: [\"üçüncü\", \"bağlam\"]}\n  ]\n</pre>              \n            "],["\n          <h2 data-tran=\"\">Example</h2>\n          <p data-tran=\"\">The following code is an example to parse srt subtitle.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-javascript\">\n/*\n  Translator++ is using regexp-match-indices\n  by that all RegExp.exec() method will return their group offset\n  read more about Regular Expression Indices here: https://v8.dev/features/regexp-match-indices\n*/\n\nvar result \t\t\t= [];\nvar captureGroup \t= 1;\nvar regex \t\t\t= /\\d+[\\r\\n]+\\d+:\\d+:\\d+,\\d+ --&gt; \\d+:\\d+:\\d+,\\d+[\\r\\n]+((.+\\r?\\n)+(?=(\\r?\\n)?))/g;\nwhile(null != (matches=regex.exec(text))) {\n  console.log(matches);\n  if (!matches?.indices?.[captureGroup]) continue;\n  result.push({\n    start\t: matches.indices[captureGroup][0],\n    end\t\t: matches.indices[captureGroup][1]\n  })\n}\nreturn result;             \n</code>\n</pre>\n        ","\n          <h2 data-tran=\"\">Örnek</h2>\n          <p data-tran=\"\">Aşağıdaki kod, srt altyazılarını ayrıştırmak için bir örnektir.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-javascript\">\n/*\n  Translator++ regexp-match-indices kullanıyor\n  böylece tüm RegExp.exec() yöntemleri grup ofsetlerini döndürecektir\n  Regular Expression Indices hakkında daha fazla bilgi: https://v8.dev/features/regexp-match-indices\n*/\n\nvar result \t\t\t= [];\nvar captureGroup \t= 1;\nvar regex \t\t\t= /\\d+[\\r\\n]+\\d+:\\d+:\\d+,\\d+ --&gt; \\d+:\\d+:\\d+,\\d+[\\r\\n]+((.+\\r?\\n)+(?=(\\r?\\n)?))/g;\nwhile(null != (matches=regex.exec(text))) {\n  console.log(matches);\n  if (!matches?.indices?.[captureGroup]) continue;\n  result.push({\n    start\t: matches.indices[captureGroup][0],\n    end\t\t: matches.indices[captureGroup][1]\n  })\n}\nreturn result;             \n</code>\n</pre>\n        "],["The following code is an example to parse srt subtitle.","Aşağıdaki kod, srt altyazılarını ayrıştırmak için bir örnektir."],["Welcome to the Custom Parser Model Creator","Özel Ayrıştırıcı Model Oluşturucu'ya hoş geldiniz"],["Please start by creating a new File Group.","Lütfen yeni bir Dosya Grubu oluşturarak başlayın."],["Please define what kind of file you want to parse by clicking\n      <button class=\"addFileGroup\" onclick=\"addFileGroup(this)\"><i class=\"icon-plus-circled\"></i>Add a new file group</button> button.\n    ","Lütfen ayrıştırmak istediğiniz dosya türünü tanımlamak için\n      <button class=\"addFileGroup\" onclick=\"addFileGroup(this)\"><i class=\"icon-plus-circled\"></i>Yeni bir dosya grubu ekle</button> düğmesine tıklayın.\n    "],["Press F1 to open the help dialog.","Yardım iletişim kutusunu açmak için F1'e basın."],["New File","Yeni Dosya"],["Open file","Dosya aç"],["Save file","Dosyayı kaydet"],["Save As","Farklı kaydet"],["Open debugger (F12)","Hata ayıklayıcıyı aç (F12)"],["Help","Yardım"],["Edit current file pattern","Geçerli dosya desenini düzenle"],["Add a new file pattern","Yeni bir dosya deseni ekle"],["Remove current file pattern","Geçerli dosya desenini kaldır"],["Rule's order does matter, especially when you use masking! Drag to reorder.","Kuralların sırası önemlidir, özellikle maskeleme kullanırken! Yeniden sıralamak için sürükleyin."]],"context":[["idx/0/innerText"],["idx/1/innerText"],["idx/2/innerText"],["idx/3/innerText"],["idx/4/innerText"],["idx/5/innerText"],["idx/6/innerText"],["idx/7/innerText","idx/29/innerText"],["idx/8/innerText"],["idx/9/innerText"],["idx/10/innerText","idx/16/innerText","idx/28/innerText","idx/69/innerText"],["idx/11/innerText"],["idx/12/innerText"],["idx/13/innerText"],["idx/14/innerText"],["idx/15/innerText"],["idx/17/innerText"],["idx/18/innerText"],["idx/19/innerText"],["idx/20/innerText"],["idx/21/innerText"],["idx/22/innerText"],["idx/23/innerText"],["idx/24/innerText"],["idx/25/innerText"],["idx/26/innerText"],["idx/27/innerText"],["idx/30/innerText"],["idx/31/innerText"],["idx/32/innerText"],["idx/33/innerText"],["idx/34/innerText"],["idx/35/innerText"],["idx/36/innerText"],["idx/37/innerText"],["idx/38/innerText"],["idx/39/innerText"],["idx/40/innerText"],["idx/41/innerText"],["idx/42/innerText"],["idx/43/innerText"],["idx/44/innerText"],["idx/45/innerText"],["idx/46/innerText"],["idx/47/innerText"],["idx/48/innerText"],["idx/49/innerText"],["idx/50/innerText"],["idx/51/innerText"],["idx/52/innerText"],["idx/53/innerText"],["idx/54/innerText"],["idx/55/innerText"],["idx/56/innerText"],["idx/57/innerText"],["idx/58/innerText"],["idx/59/innerText"],["idx/60/innerText"],["idx/61/innerText"],["idx/62/innerText"],["idx/63/innerText"],["idx/64/innerText"],["idx/65/innerText"],["idx/66/innerText"],["idx/67/innerText"],["idx/68/innerText"],["idx/70/innerText"],["idx/71/innerText"],["idx/72/innerText"],["idx/73/innerText"],["idx/74/innerText"],["idx/0/attr/title"],["idx/1/attr/title"],["idx/2/attr/title"],["idx/3/attr/title"],["idx/4/attr/title"],["idx/5/attr/title"],["idx/6/attr/title"],["idx/7/attr/title"],["idx/8/attr/title"],["idx/9/attr/title"]],"basename":"modelEditor.html","dirname":"/addons/customParser/modelEditor","extension":".html","filename":"modelEditor.html","path":"/addons/customParser/modelEditor/modelEditor.html","indexIsBuilt":false,"indexIds":{"<i class=\"icon-edit\"></i>":0,"<i class=\"icon-plus-circled\"></i><label data-tran=\"\">Add a new file group</label>":1,"Add a new file group":2,"<i class=\"icon-cancel-circled red\"></i><label data-tran=\"\">Remove current file group</label>":3,"Remove current file group":4,"Rules":5,"Hooks":6,"Options":7,"Testing":8,"Interpolate the strings before being displayed on the cells. <b>To Grid</b> is antithesis of <b>From Grid</b>":9,"Example":10,"For example, the text obtained from the parser is as follows:":11,"In this grid it will look like this:":12,"That's not the easiest text to work with.<br>\n  We can fix that by declaring <span class=\"inlineCode\">To Grid hooks</span> as follows:\n":13,"With the hook above the text in the grid will be :":14,"Interpolate the strings from the cells into the translation result. <b>From Grid</b> is antithesis of <b>To Grid</b>.":15,"\n  For example, the expected translated strings should be in JSON format.<br>\n  But writing translation in JSON format is not realy the easiest thing to do. <br>\n  So, instead of asking our translator to translate in JSON format, we can just ask them to type normally, and add a <span class=\"inlineCode\">From Grid hook</span> as follows:\n":16,"\n  With the <span class=\"inlineCode\">From Grid hook</span> above, the following translation ...\n":17,"...will be converted into desired format: ":18,"Edit the translated text just before writing it into a file.":19,"Parameters":20,"\n              <h3 data-tran=\"\">text</h3>\n              <p data-tran=\"\">The text that is about to be written into a file.</p>\n            ":21,"text":22,"The text that is about to be written into a file.":23,"Return value":24,"\n              <h3><i>String</i></h3>\n              <p data-tran=\"\">The text that will be written into a file.</p>\n            ":25,"The text that will be written into a file.":26,"General":27,"Read character encoding":28,"Force parser to use the following character encoding when reading the file(s).":29,"Write character encoding":30,"Force parser to use the following character encoding when writing the file(s).":31,"You are editing:":32,"Please select the mode of your pattern":33,"Regular expression Pattern":34,"A valid ECMA Script's regular expression along with the modifier.<br>You can use <a href=\"https://regex101.com/\" class=\"externalLink\" external=\"\">regex101.com</a> to create and test your pattern.":35,"Pay attention to the use of carriage return (\\r) in the text to be translated. regex101.com will strip out the carriage returns so your pattern may have a different effect than what you see on regex101. ":36,"<strong>About quantifier that captures a zero length string.</strong><br>\n            <i>Null</i> strings will cause problems for the parser. Therefore, instead of using the <strong>*</strong> quantifier which will also capture <i>nulls</i>, it is highly recommended to use the <strong>+</strong> quantifier which will only capture strings if exist.":37,"Translatable Capture groups":38,"Index of the regular expression's groups (Integer) for the translatable texts. Can be more than one. Separate with comma.":39,"Row Info Capture group":40,"\n            Index of the regular expression's group (Integer) for the row info (e.g. character name). <b>Only one group</b> is allowed. <br>\n            The value of the Row info can be carried over to the child rules and will be overwritten by the child rule's Row info value if exist.\n          ":41,"Context template":42,"\n            Context is unique identifier for translatable texts. <br>\n            You can use Javascript's template literals to add information to the context.<br>\n            <b>Available variable:</b>\n            <ul>\n              <li><span class=\"inlineCode\">GROUP[<i>n</i>]</span> - Group capture.</li>\n              <!-- <li><span class=\"inlineCode\">RULE_ID</span> - The ID of the rule.</li> -->\n            </ul>\n            <br>\n            <b>Example:</b>\n            <pre>item/${GROUP[2]}</pre>\n          ":43,"Action":44,"Capture value":45,"Capture then mask value":46,"Mask value":47,"Send to inner rule":48,"Edit inner rule <i class=\"icon-angle-double-right\"></i>":49,"What action the pattern is going to do.":50,"Javascript function":51,"Guide":52,"\n          <h2 data-tran=\"\">Arguments</h2>\n          <p data-tran=\"\">The code you write will be inside a function with 2 arguments that can be accessed anywhere in your code:</p>\n          <ul>\n            <li>\n              <h3>text</h3>\n              <p><b>String</b></p>\n              <p data-tran=\"\">A string of the entire content of the file.</p>\n            </li>\n            <li>\n              <h3>thisModel</h3>\n              <p><b>Object</b></p>\n              <p data-tran=\"\">The rule object that is currently used by the file.</p>\n            </li>\n          </ul>\n          <h2 data-tran=\"\"><i>this</i> Keyword</h2>\n          <p data-tran=\"\"><b>this</b> will reffer to the instance of CustomParser class.</p>\n\n        ":53,"Arguments":54,"The code you write will be inside a function with 2 arguments that can be accessed anywhere in your code:":55,"A string of the entire content of the file.":56,"The rule object that is currently used by the file.":57,"<i>this</i> Keyword":58,"<b>this</b> will reffer to the instance of CustomParser class.":59,"\n          <h2 data-tran=\"\">Expected Return Value</h2>\n          <p data-tran=\"\">Your code must <b>return</b> one of the following value:</p>\n          <ul>\n            <li><pre>undefined</pre></li>\n            <li data-tran=\"\">Offset of the captured text, for example:\n<pre>  {\n    start:100,\n    end:120,\n    rowInfoText:\"Character Name\", // Character name. optional\n    context: [\"some\", \"context\", \"here\"] // Context. optional\n  }\n</pre>\n            </li>\n            <li data-tran=\"\">Array of the offset of the captured text, for example:\n<pre>  [\n    {start:0, end:5, rowInfoText:\"Character Name\", context: [\"some\", \"context\", \"here\"]},\n    {start:12, end:30, rowInfoText:\"Another Character\", context: [\"another\", \"context\"]},\n    {start:4581, end:4593, rowInfoText:\"Third Character\", context: [\"third\", \"context\"]}\n  ]\n</pre>              \n            </li>\n          </ul>\n        ":60,"Expected Return Value":61,"Your code must <b>return</b> one of the following value:":62,"Offset of the captured text, for example:\n<pre>  {\n    start:100,\n    end:120,\n    rowInfoText:\"Character Name\", // Character name. optional\n    context: [\"some\", \"context\", \"here\"] // Context. optional\n  }\n</pre>\n            ":63,"Array of the offset of the captured text, for example:\n<pre>  [\n    {start:0, end:5, rowInfoText:\"Character Name\", context: [\"some\", \"context\", \"here\"]},\n    {start:12, end:30, rowInfoText:\"Another Character\", context: [\"another\", \"context\"]},\n    {start:4581, end:4593, rowInfoText:\"Third Character\", context: [\"third\", \"context\"]}\n  ]\n</pre>              \n            ":64,"\n          <h2 data-tran=\"\">Example</h2>\n          <p data-tran=\"\">The following code is an example to parse srt subtitle.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-javascript\">\n/*\n  Translator++ is using regexp-match-indices\n  by that all RegExp.exec() method will return their group offset\n  read more about Regular Expression Indices here: https://v8.dev/features/regexp-match-indices\n*/\n\nvar result \t\t\t= [];\nvar captureGroup \t= 1;\nvar regex \t\t\t= /\\d+[\\r\\n]+\\d+:\\d+:\\d+,\\d+ --&gt; \\d+:\\d+:\\d+,\\d+[\\r\\n]+((.+\\r?\\n)+(?=(\\r?\\n)?))/g;\nwhile(null != (matches=regex.exec(text))) {\n  console.log(matches);\n  if (!matches?.indices?.[captureGroup]) continue;\n  result.push({\n    start\t: matches.indices[captureGroup][0],\n    end\t\t: matches.indices[captureGroup][1]\n  })\n}\nreturn result;             \n</code>\n</pre>\n        ":65,"The following code is an example to parse srt subtitle.":66,"Welcome to the Custom Parser Model Creator":67,"Please start by creating a new File Group.":68,"Please define what kind of file you want to parse by clicking\n      <button class=\"addFileGroup\" onclick=\"addFileGroup(this)\"><i class=\"icon-plus-circled\"></i>Add a new file group</button> button.\n    ":69,"Press F1 to open the help dialog.":70,"New File":71,"Open file":72,"Save file":73,"Save As":74,"Open debugger (F12)":75,"Help":76,"Edit current file pattern":77,"Add a new file pattern":78,"Remove current file pattern":79,"Rule's order does matter, especially when you use masking! Drag to reorder.":80},"tags":[],"relPath":"/addons/customParser/modelEditor/modelEditor.html","originalFormat":"Autogenerated TRANS obj","type":"","progress":{"translated":81,"length":81,"percent":100},"parameters":[]},"/addons/customParser/modelEditor/modelEditor.js":{"data":[["Do you want to close Model editor?\rAll unsaved changes will be discarded.","Model düzenleyiciyi kapatmak istiyor musunuz?\rKaydedilmemiş tüm değişiklikler kaybolacak."],["Translate here using ","Burada çeviri yapın "],["Do you want to discard your changes and open\n","Değişikliklerinizi atmak ve açmak istiyor musunuz?\n"],["Error when trying to open file :","Dosya açılırken hata oluştu:"],["Parser Model Creator","Ayrıştırıcı Model Oluşturucu"],["Please specify what kind of file you want to parse.\nYou can use semicolon separated glob pattens. For example: *.txt;*.js;*.json","Lütfen ayrıştırmak istediğiniz dosya türünü belirtin.\nNoktalı virgülle ayrılmış glob desenleri kullanabilirsiniz. Örneğin: *.txt;*.js;*.json"],["Failed to create new file group. Please check your pattern!","Yeni dosya grubu oluşturulamadı. Lütfen deseninizi kontrol edin!"],["Do you wish to remove current file group?\nYou can not undo this action!","Mevcut dosya grubunu kaldırmak istiyor musunuz?\nBu işlem geri alınamaz!"],["Do you want to discard your changes and create a new blank model?","Değişikliklerinizi iptal edip yeni boş bir model oluşturmak istiyor musunuz?"],["Do you want to discard your changes and open a file?","Değişikliklerinizi iptal edip bir dosya açmak istiyor musunuz?"],["Clear history","Geçmişi temizle"],["Open latest file","En son dosyayı aç"],["Open from history","Geçmişten aç"],["This feature only available if you are using Developer version of Translator++. You can switch into Developer version b